WEBVTT

00:04.133 --> 00:05.845
Phew.

00:06.137 --> 00:07.389
THAT WAS FUN!!
Hěn kāixīn!

00:07.389 --> 00:09.645
It’s been a while since I’ve had
a bout like that!

00:13.945 --> 00:15.990
You’re being distracted, Master Shen.

00:16.199 --> 00:18.245
Oh, so you’re already back, Mui.

00:18.245 --> 00:19.581
Mind smoothing things over with the top boss?

00:19.581 --> 00:21.961
I have delivered a convincing report.

00:22.336 --> 00:23.255
THANK YOU!
Xièxiè!

00:23.421 --> 00:24.883
Master Shen!

00:24.883 --> 00:26.512
Oh, right...

00:26.512 --> 00:28.139
REFLECT, REMORSE
Fanxing, Fanxing.

00:31.020 --> 00:32.774
About the matter at Lake Baikal...

00:32.774 --> 00:37.576
Ms. Gena has contacted both Undead and Unluck,
and will now enter battle.

00:37.576 --> 00:38.536
Aah...

00:38.536 --> 00:40.455
Well, those two have tricks up their sleeves!

00:40.790 --> 00:42.627
I’m sure they will overcome this obstacle, too!

02:28.215 --> 02:30.427
Deady Dearest,
it’s been far too long!

02:31.847 --> 02:33.684
I still can’t cut ya.

02:33.684 --> 02:35.395
That’s your Rule, ain’t it?

02:35.479 --> 02:36.439
Hold the phone!

02:36.690 --> 02:40.239
You’re so cruel! Our first reunion in 40 years,
and the first thing you do is cut me?

02:40.239 --> 02:43.286
Says the shrewd minx who has a barrier posted up!

02:43.579 --> 02:45.332
Um... excuse me!

02:46.627 --> 02:49.841
Are you the person
who caught Andy fifty years ago?

02:51.554 --> 02:52.471
Andy?

02:52.556 --> 02:54.016
DEADY DEAREST TRENDY ME
LI’L LUCKY‎

02:54.100 --> 02:56.437
IN OTHER WORDS, ANDY!

02:56.730 --> 02:57.398
Yeah.

02:57.398 --> 03:00.905
I caught Deady Dearest
and supervised him throughout his captivity!

03:01.155 --> 03:04.913
B-But you look the same age as me!

03:05.080 --> 03:11.384
Oh, stop it, Li’l Lucky! You’re skilled at flattery!
Such a sweet girl! Kya!

03:11.426 --> 03:16.937
You can’t be serious. You were sixteen when you caught me,
which means you’re sixty-six now.

03:16.937 --> 03:18.608
Six... sixty-six?

03:18.608 --> 03:21.739
Gotta say, the organization’s
anti-aging tech really works won-

03:22.532 --> 03:24.661
Huh? What’s wrong, Andy?

03:24.911 --> 03:27.124
You can’t be serious, Deady Dearest?

03:27.124 --> 03:30.422
You know I’m eternally sixteen.

03:30.422 --> 03:32.217
Don’t give me talk like that.

03:32.301 --> 03:32.969
Wha...?

03:35.892 --> 03:39.733
Wow, so cool!
Now this is what I call a death mask!

03:39.733 --> 03:42.697
Like, omigosh, what should I do with it?

03:42.697 --> 03:46.329
W-Well, how about a little kiss for now?

03:47.957 --> 03:48.751
Huh?

03:48.751 --> 03:53.803
It’s gone? But why? Aww, come on!
I was just getting to the good part!

03:54.136 --> 03:57.184
Something invisible was coverin’ up my mouth.

03:57.184 --> 03:59.313
I’m gonna have to figure out
a strategy to deal with that.

03:59.313 --> 04:00.817
Is your face okay?

04:01.109 --> 04:04.866
And quit worryin’ over every little thing.
I’m Undead, remember?

04:04.866 --> 04:06.285
I know, but...

04:08.666 --> 04:09.417
Li’l Lucky!

04:09.417 --> 04:10.085
Huh?

04:10.293 --> 04:13.509
I’ll have you know that I fell
in love with him first!

04:13.676 --> 04:15.011
Say what?

04:17.809 --> 04:21.650
We first crossed paths fifty years ago.

04:22.234 --> 04:27.161
It was an ill-fated encounter-
me, the hunter, and him, the hunted.

04:27.494 --> 04:30.710
While I did succeed in catching him,
all of our seats were filled.

04:31.169 --> 04:34.843
As I sat at the Roundtable,
he sat in a cell.

04:35.177 --> 04:38.601
After I was put in charge of overseeing him,
I said to him...

04:39.644 --> 04:40.938
Um...

04:40.938 --> 04:42.191
I’m sorry.

04:42.525 --> 04:47.619
I was just following orders, but if I hadn’t caught you...
then none of this would have-

04:48.996 --> 04:51.710
<i>But my Deady Dearest simply replied...</i>

04:51.919 --> 04:57.054
Huh? What’re ya on about?
I got beat. Simple as that.

04:58.808 --> 05:02.231
Plus, I can die in all sorts
of ways while I’m here.

05:02.607 --> 05:05.320
There’s no better way to figure out
my own set of Rules.

05:07.324 --> 05:11.542
When I finally break outta here,
let’s have a rematch.

05:11.542 --> 05:13.253
You can bet your ass
I ain’t losin’ the next one!

05:14.714 --> 05:19.599
Hngh! That was so cool!
I love you!

05:20.893 --> 05:23.064
So that’s how she fell in love?

05:23.398 --> 05:28.032
Yet, you escaped ten years later
without so much as a word to me!

05:28.408 --> 05:33.293
And for the next forty years,
you completely dropped off the map!

05:33.502 --> 05:37.467
But since meeting Li’l Lucky,
you’ve been running all over the place.

05:37.467 --> 05:39.764
I was finally able to find you the other day!

05:40.432 --> 05:41.977
Oh, the joy I felt when I-

05:44.064 --> 05:46.570
C’mon! She wasn’t done with her monologue!

05:47.572 --> 05:51.412
That’s why I wanted to be
the first one to come see you.

05:51.412 --> 05:53.584
But that lousy Shen...

05:53.667 --> 05:57.842
He went ahead on his own
and put his dirty paws on my Deady Dearest!

05:57.842 --> 05:59.971
I’ll never forgive him for that!

06:00.263 --> 06:03.436
He was supposed
to alert me when he found you!

06:03.938 --> 06:07.277
The combat-crazed cretin!

06:09.114 --> 06:12.789
But I do give him credit
for taking Void with him.

06:12.789 --> 06:15.377
Thanks to his death,
a single seat opened up after all!

06:16.922 --> 06:20.554
And that’s all we need.
You can fill that seat alone.

06:23.226 --> 06:24.478
<i>Flashbangs work on her, eh?</i>

06:24.478 --> 06:26.273
<i>Now’s my chance.
Her barrier’s gotta be-</i>

06:27.944 --> 06:29.614
<i>So she didn’t drop it.</i>

06:32.870 --> 06:34.289
Shouldn’t we run while we still can?

06:34.289 --> 06:38.214
Wazzat? Why would we do that?
I’m gathering intel.

06:38.214 --> 06:39.968
B-But...

06:42.305 --> 06:45.437
Oh, yeah! Your friends!
Where are they?

06:45.688 --> 06:49.236
Right... they’re dead.
All of ‘em croaked.

06:49.236 --> 06:51.032
Wha-? Then what now?

06:51.323 --> 06:54.288
I snagged seats at a different spot for that party.

06:54.288 --> 06:56.501
This one’s got rockin’ beef stroganoff!

06:56.793 --> 06:58.087
No time to talk about that right now!

07:01.177 --> 07:04.601
Cool your jets, kid.
I’ve got this in the bag!

07:04.601 --> 07:08.734
What she actually negates...
I’ll bust that lid wide open!

07:09.151 --> 07:11.740
One, she solidified the lake.

07:13.242 --> 07:16.750
Two, she telekinetically lifted it up.

07:18.336 --> 07:24.181
Three, she can create invisible walls and stairs-
her main ability.

07:24.808 --> 07:28.231
<i>Let’s say her ability is hardening stuff.</i>

07:28.397 --> 07:31.112
<i>Then she solidified water in case One,
but what about case Three?</i>

07:32.615 --> 07:36.915
<i>I mean, if she’s just hardening stuff,
then my sword skills should be able to slice through.</i>

07:36.915 --> 07:40.840
<i>So what is she negating to form that barrier of hers?</i>

07:45.265 --> 07:46.308
Tuck your legs!

07:46.308 --> 07:47.060
Huh?

07:53.489 --> 07:58.166
Y’know, that last attack... you coulda dodged that
if you didn’t have to worry about Li’l Lucky.

08:00.211 --> 08:03.301
If only she had died back then...

08:03.301 --> 08:05.723
this would’ve been a better fight.

08:07.685 --> 08:08.645
“Back then”?

08:08.937 --> 08:10.398
Back on the boat.

08:10.398 --> 08:13.154
My projectiles should’ve killed her.

08:14.364 --> 08:15.826
<i>That attack, huh?</i>

08:17.329 --> 08:19.416
W-What’s wrong?
Can’t you move?

08:19.416 --> 08:21.713
I’ve restrained your lower half.

08:21.713 --> 08:23.967
Now you can’t run away from me.

08:23.967 --> 08:26.263
Oh, she’s right!
There is something there!

08:26.263 --> 08:29.436
Just give up on all this Unluck business.

08:29.436 --> 08:31.775
That girl would never be able
to meet her quota-

08:31.775 --> 08:33.110
Doesn’t matter!

08:33.528 --> 08:38.037
Whether this is fate or not...
no matter what happens to us down the road...

08:38.162 --> 08:39.666
This girl is mine!

08:40.751 --> 08:43.256
I ain’t lettin’ her die till I do!

08:45.511 --> 08:46.428
Fine.

08:48.517 --> 08:51.438
Then I’ll just take your head
like I did fifty years ago.

08:52.440 --> 08:57.117
And once I do, Deady Dearest...
you’ll be mine forever.

08:57.535 --> 08:58.662
I’m heading out!

08:58.662 --> 09:00.582
What? Are you trying
to get caught again?

09:00.582 --> 09:04.214
I figured it out... what she negates.

09:08.389 --> 09:09.684
- Huh?
- Huh?

09:09.809 --> 09:12.230
Parts Bullet... Head!

09:12.355 --> 09:14.484
PARTS BULLET HEAD

09:15.069 --> 09:17.575
Plus... bodily repair!

09:20.496 --> 09:21.666
- Wha-
- Wha-

09:27.093 --> 09:28.054
Gena!

09:29.139 --> 09:32.772
You negate an object’s change in form.

09:34.024 --> 09:38.366
All of your invisible attacks have been negating
the change in the air itself.

09:38.491 --> 09:41.497
But covered in all this blood,
it’s as clear as day!

09:42.123 --> 09:45.631
Unchange! That’s your ability!

09:49.471 --> 09:52.435
And? You can do something about it
with your Undead powers?

09:52.728 --> 09:55.441
Heck no.
At least, not on my own.

09:59.324 --> 10:01.120
Y’know what that means.

10:01.495 --> 10:03.792
Lend me a hand, kid!

10:15.860 --> 10:20.118
So you negate variations in form.
Unchange, eh?

10:20.536 --> 10:24.669
And I’m guessin’ those hands
are a result of you fixing the air in place.

10:24.836 --> 10:25.713
Right.

10:25.713 --> 10:29.052
Not even you can slip from their grasp once
they take hold, Deady Dearest.

10:29.344 --> 10:31.725
I admit, not being able
to touch you is a pain, but...

10:31.725 --> 10:33.770
...that doesn’t mean we’re out of options.

10:34.062 --> 10:35.482
Ain’t that right, kid?

10:37.612 --> 10:39.949
Cover as much surface area as you can.

10:39.949 --> 10:43.582
Okay... um... f-for how many minutes?

10:43.582 --> 10:44.374
No clue.

10:46.838 --> 10:48.257
Wait up, Li’l Lucky!

10:48.257 --> 10:50.596
W-Wh-What are you doing with those knockers-

10:50.638 --> 10:52.390
I’ve got no other choice!

10:52.474 --> 10:56.106
This is no way for a girl to act in publi-

10:59.196 --> 11:03.204
Li’l Lucky... I didn’t think you were a naughty girl.

11:03.539 --> 11:04.373
Huh?

11:04.582 --> 11:08.757
I see now that you’ve seduced
Deady Dearest with those melons.

11:08.924 --> 11:09.884
Wha-

11:10.301 --> 11:16.355
I knew something was off.
Why else would he keep such a weak girl by his side?

11:18.359 --> 11:21.700
Give it 20 years!
Those things are bound to droop by then!

11:21.700 --> 11:23.411
Droop? That’ll never happen!

11:23.411 --> 11:27.252
Oh, I beg to differ! Not to brag,
but when it comes to that, I’m invincible!

11:27.587 --> 11:29.131
Unchange!

11:30.216 --> 11:32.638
‘Cause I will always remain the same!

11:32.930 --> 11:37.272
Wazzat? What’re you even talkin’ about?
you know you’re an External Targeter, right?

11:37.272 --> 11:38.650
External Targeter?

11:38.650 --> 11:40.779
Negators come in two types.

11:40.779 --> 11:44.411
Self-Targeting Types like me can only use
their powers on themselves.

11:44.494 --> 11:45.413
AUGH

11:45.998 --> 11:50.758
External-Targeting Types like you
and Gena affect anyone other than themselves.

11:50.841 --> 11:51.885
DROP

11:52.093 --> 11:55.224
Excuse me?
I’m a Self-Targeter!

11:55.224 --> 11:57.980
One look at my timeless body
should be enough to tell you that.

11:58.356 --> 11:59.609
In Gena’s case...

11:59.901 --> 12:01.571
She just cakes on the makeup.

12:02.072 --> 12:04.034
I’ll admit her chest ain’t changed at all.

12:04.535 --> 12:06.790
But her ass is saggin’ somethin’ fierce.

12:07.290 --> 12:09.336
She’s an External Targeter all right.

12:09.336 --> 12:12.258
I’m bettin’ Unchange works on everything
but living organisms.

12:12.760 --> 12:20.400
Don’t you... use my girlish figure...
to prove your stupid point!

12:22.070 --> 12:23.155
Eep, not again!

12:23.532 --> 12:26.078
You dummy.
This is how I get around.

12:27.288 --> 12:29.877
Quit throwin’ a fit!
The charm’s all in that droopage!

12:30.002 --> 12:30.921
Shut up!

12:30.963 --> 12:33.134
I like it like that!

12:33.217 --> 12:36.558
That’s not a compliment!
I haven’t changed one bit!

12:37.267 --> 12:40.273
<i>Dealing with her air hands
is easy if I can see them.</i>

12:40.566 --> 12:42.235
Quit running, dammit!

12:42.485 --> 12:45.199
<i>Seems they need time
to regenerate, too.</i>

12:45.534 --> 12:49.166
<i>The real issue is figuring out how
to take down that invincible barrier of air.</i>

12:49.416 --> 12:51.504
Get off!

12:51.713 --> 12:52.548
Hey...

12:52.673 --> 12:55.344
What’s up?
Caught somethin’ I missed?

12:55.344 --> 12:56.848
Eek! You didn’t have to face me!

12:58.267 --> 13:00.773
Watching Ms. Gena in action,
something’s been bothering me.

13:00.773 --> 13:02.985
She has an invincible barrier, right?

13:02.985 --> 13:03.945
YEAH.
Meah.

13:03.945 --> 13:08.287
And she’s clearly upset, but she’s speed-walking toward us.
It just doesn’t make sense.

13:08.412 --> 13:11.251
Gah, can’t you two drop
the lewd act for even a single second?

13:11.836 --> 13:13.172
Running would be more efficient.

13:13.380 --> 13:14.424
Heh.

13:14.634 --> 13:16.094
OF COURSE!
GREAT GOIN'!
Auf horse! Vreat voin’!

13:16.094 --> 13:18.182
Stop talking with your face buried in there!

13:18.307 --> 13:20.353
I figured out how to get to her.

13:20.353 --> 13:21.480
Now all we need to do is...

13:21.606 --> 13:23.568
...find the seed of unluck!

13:23.860 --> 13:24.946
Find the seed?

13:24.946 --> 13:27.283
A real gnarly one that’ll work
on her as she’s-

13:30.999 --> 13:33.379
<i>Something’s lurkin’ up there.</i>

13:33.547 --> 13:36.093
Hey, you’re getting in
the way of the investigation.

13:43.525 --> 13:45.486
Didn’t that idiot Shen tell you?

13:46.154 --> 13:49.119
We’re investigating a UMA
that’s supposedly hiding out here.

13:49.119 --> 13:53.920
I’ve been running a scan of the lake,
using my ability to split up and harden it into chunks.

13:54.547 --> 13:57.176
I was reluctantly doing this so
that I’d meet my quota...

13:57.553 --> 14:00.642
but I’ve had my fill.
Let’s wrap this up.

14:03.480 --> 14:07.280
My prey that replaces that UMA...
I’m staring right at it.

14:08.073 --> 14:10.161
Isn’t that right, Li’l Lucky?

14:15.212 --> 14:16.340
Is that a UFO?

14:16.340 --> 14:19.555
So that’s what was hidin’ up there.

14:19.931 --> 14:24.356
Li’l Lucky... you told me that you prefer change, right?

14:24.899 --> 14:27.153
Well, I don’t like it at all.

14:28.907 --> 14:31.829
<i>I want to be like how I was back then.</i>

14:32.330 --> 14:35.252
<i>I want to be with the one I love forever.</i>

14:43.435 --> 14:48.153
No matter how much I hurt others,
I’ll remain in the organization...

14:48.153 --> 14:50.659
...so I can keep chasing after him forever.

14:52.705 --> 14:57.589
The greatest change for a person is death.
So if you want to change so bad...

14:58.340 --> 14:59.885
...do it on your own time!

15:11.450 --> 15:13.454
I actually agree, Gena.

15:15.834 --> 15:21.804
To be born and to die-
these greatest forms of change sound so sick!

15:25.102 --> 15:26.522
But y’know...

15:26.731 --> 15:28.150
That “Death” is mine!

15:28.651 --> 15:30.614
It ain’t for her!

15:34.830 --> 15:37.376
I’m gonna make damn sure she survives!

15:37.961 --> 15:40.842
Then I’ll woo her over
and over till she falls head over heels!

15:41.594 --> 15:43.640
She will change as much as she can!

15:44.140 --> 15:47.105
I’ll change her heart.
Then we seal the deal-and I’ll change my mortality!

15:47.271 --> 15:49.819
She can’t die till after that happens.

15:51.113 --> 15:54.285
How optimistic.
That sounds like you, though.

15:54.620 --> 15:56.248
<i>That blood trail...</i>

15:56.582 --> 16:00.632
Joining the organization
is a painful and hollow ordeal.

16:01.174 --> 16:04.013
That girl would never last.

16:05.182 --> 16:07.478
That’s why, right here and now-

16:07.688 --> 16:09.274
Hey, listen up.

16:09.274 --> 16:09.942
Huh?

16:18.041 --> 16:19.503
<i>All right, listen closely.</i>

16:20.129 --> 16:23.636
<i>There’s a hole in the barrier,
down beneath her feet.</i>

16:24.722 --> 16:26.893
<i>She wouldn’t be able
to walk around otherwise.</i>

16:26.893 --> 16:29.648
<i>If I can slip through the hole...</i>

16:30.024 --> 16:33.740
<i>I can beat her with the unluck I’ve
been charging up this whole time.</i>

16:34.575 --> 16:37.246
<i>But that hole is tiny!</i>

16:37.455 --> 16:41.421
<i>I can tell from the blood trail
from the barrier dragging along the ground.</i>

16:41.589 --> 16:43.927
<i>At best, I could squeeze my head in...</i>

16:43.927 --> 16:46.264
<i>but even if I got in,
she’d kick me right out.</i>

16:48.728 --> 16:49.855
<i>So, if anything...</i>

17:10.647 --> 17:11.565
Now...

17:11.983 --> 17:13.068
<i>Is he trying to blind me?</i>

17:13.277 --> 17:14.445
It’s up to you.

17:14.445 --> 17:15.281
Right!

17:15.740 --> 17:17.911
Should I temporarily release my Unchange?

17:23.046 --> 17:24.173
That hole...

17:24.591 --> 17:27.723
I can fit if it’s only my head!

17:28.015 --> 17:30.812
- Unluck Unleashed!
- Unluck Unleashed!

17:32.231 --> 17:33.066
<i>All right...</i>

17:34.570 --> 17:37.033
<i>Gena, let’s bring in some change!</i>

17:38.285 --> 17:43.128
Unluck occurring outside your barrier
probably can’t take you down.

17:43.462 --> 17:48.013
Even if it summoned a meteorite,
I doubt that’d even put a crack in it.

17:48.556 --> 17:51.646
But once I’m inside the barrier...

17:51.646 --> 17:55.110
...the Unluck that kills me will come inside with me!

17:55.110 --> 17:59.410
Since your barrier is composed of air...
light passes through it just fine.

17:59.410 --> 18:01.874
So the Unluck’ll be light-based.

18:01.874 --> 18:03.628
And I’m hedgin’ my bets on...

18:03.920 --> 18:05.089
...that thing!

18:20.995 --> 18:22.958
A-Andy...

18:45.421 --> 18:48.051
<i>Her power has been released.
That means...</i>

18:48.595 --> 18:49.680
Ms. Gena!

19:09.385 --> 19:10.471
Pervert.

19:11.891 --> 19:14.855
It was fun while it lasted, Gena.

19:16.818 --> 19:17.903
See ya around.

19:21.159 --> 19:22.036
Wait!

19:38.193 --> 19:42.578
I chose not to put her out of her misery.
She doesn’t have much longer anyway.

19:42.578 --> 19:44.038
That can’t be.

19:46.459 --> 19:49.508
Weren’t you prepared for the worst
when you joined this fight?

19:52.931 --> 19:54.935
I wanted to change.

19:55.144 --> 19:56.187
Huh?

19:56.187 --> 20:00.404
I was at the Union’s mercy.
I was at their beck and call.

20:01.072 --> 20:05.790
I’ve captured and executed so many...
man and beast alike.

20:07.460 --> 20:08.462
And yet...

20:08.880 --> 20:10.842
...not a single thing changed.

20:11.927 --> 20:14.223
Not the world, and not me.

20:15.059 --> 20:22.031
I’m sure the world will gain more Rules...
and go through a huge change.

20:23.367 --> 20:26.916
I thought that our mission was
to prevent change in this world.

20:27.918 --> 20:31.634
I believed that was our life’s mission, but...

20:33.136 --> 20:34.807
...perhaps I was wrong.

20:40.986 --> 20:45.202
Your painting was so beautiful.

20:45.995 --> 20:52.258
Sparkles around the moon?
The idea never even crossed my mind.

20:54.303 --> 20:57.268
I may not have been able to change, but...

20:57.268 --> 21:02.027
maybe change in itself...
isn’t so bad after all.

21:03.990 --> 21:05.492
Now, go.

21:05.869 --> 21:08.331
The anti-aging is starting to wear off.

21:08.833 --> 21:11.797
I don’t want to be seen
in such a hideous state.

21:12.339 --> 21:16.766
Don’t worry. As for your seats in the Union,
you two are as good as in-

21:25.617 --> 21:28.497
Stop... not while I look like this.

21:34.802 --> 21:36.095
You dummy.

21:36.095 --> 21:39.393
A few wrinkles ain’t gonna change
how beautiful you are.

21:50.708 --> 21:55.718
NO.004
DO YOU LOVE THE CHANGE IN ME?

22:01.479 --> 22:05.947
TO BE CONTINUED

23:35.960 --> 23:36.461
PREVIEW

23:36.795 --> 23:42.389
<i>With no time to be laden in sorrow, the world leads
the girl and the undead man to their next destiny.</i>

23:42.389 --> 23:44.644
<i>That is the beginning of a new battle.</i>

23:44.853 --> 23:48.778
<i>Next episode of Undead Unluck, Episode 5-
United We Negate.</i>

23:48.861 --> 23:50.907
<i>In search of the greatest death ever.</i>
